<title>USA: Massachusetts Health &amp; Ed raises monthly div.</title>
<headline>Massachusetts Health &amp; Ed raises monthly div.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts Health &amp; Education Tax-Exempt Trust said Tuesday it had declared regular monthly dividends of $0.61 per share, payable March 31 and April 30, and had increased the dividend to $0.62 per share for May, payable May 29.</p>
<p>The record dates for the dividends are March 14, April 15 and May 15, respectively.</p>
